    <h1>
      Arctic Adventors - Booking Information 1996
    </h1>
    <p>
      Registration is to be forwarded to:
    </p>
<pre>
Arctic Adventours a.s.       or   Arctic Adventours a.s.
P.O.Box 969         Box 2089 Grünerløkka 
N-8001 Bodø       N-0505 Oslo   
NORWAY                NORWAY

Phone: +47 81 24220     Phone: +47 2237-2177
Fax:   +47 81 27479     Fax:   +47 2237-2861
</pre>
    Since last year there is one big administrative improvement. You
    are no longer dependent of knowing Knut's position in the world
    to get a booking confirmed or a question answered. You can call
    Knut in Oslo or you can try our phone in Bodø and ask for Bård
    Helge Andreassen. We are also using the Internet now and can be
    reached at the following email address: 
<pre>
  arcadv@oslonett.no 
</pre>
    <h2>
      Bookings &amp; registrations
    </h2>
    <p>
      Bookings are registered by any agreement that make us confident
      and pulling least efforts and inconvenience. Normally that
      means that the bookings are kept by a deposit of 20% of the
      price of the expedition. The rest is to be paid 6 weeks before
      departure, wherafter the deposit are not guaranteed refundable.
      But normally we have more request than space available, so you
      will normally get the deposit refunded. (We do not ask for any
      reasons, because nobody is booking off expeditions like this
      freely.)
    </p>
    <hr />
<pre>
